seo-gsc-setup-steps =
    Search Console / GA4 use your own Google Cloud OAuth client (Kor ships none):
      1. Open https://console.cloud.google.com and create or pick a project.
      2. Enable "Google Search Console API" and "Google Analytics Data API".
      3. OAuth consent screen: type External, add yourself as a test user.
      4. Credentials → Create credentials → OAuth client ID → type "Desktop app"; download the JSON.
      5. kor seo gsc setup --client-json <file.json>, then kor seo gsc login
